<article class="env-lemma" id="0BAM">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0BAM">Lemma <span data-tag="0BAM">66.10.1</span>.</a> Let $S$ be a scheme. Let $X$ be an algebraic space over $S$. Let $x \in |X|$ be a point. Let $d \in \{ 0, 1, 2, \ldots , \infty \} $. The following are equivalent </p>
  <p><ol>
  <li><p>
for some scheme $U$ and étale morphism $a : U \to X$ and point $u \in U$ with $a(u) = x$ we have $\dim (\mathcal{O}_{U, u}) = d$, 
</p>
</li><li><p>
for any scheme $U$, any étale morphism $a : U \to X$, and any point $u \in U$ with $a(u) = x$ we have $\dim (\mathcal{O}_{U, u}) = d$. 
</p>
</li>
</ol></p>
  <p> If $X$ is a scheme, this is equivalent to $\dim (\mathcal{O}_{X, x}) = d$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Combine Lemma <a href="/tag/04N2" data-tag="04N2">66.7.4</a> and Descent, Lemma <a href="/tag/04N8" data-tag="04N8">35.21.3</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>